{"id":"19808bbb30df7231","group":"58","path":"58/batch12/58-df-zfc-comb9-transversal-number-witness.md","title":"ZFC Comb9 Transversal Number Witness","display":"df-zfc-comb9-transversal-number-witness — ZFC Comb9 Transversal Number Witness","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-comb9-transversal-number-witness","aliases":["58-df-zfc-comb9-transversal-number-witness"],"display":"df-zfc-comb9-transversal-number-witness — ZFC Comb9 Transversal Number Witness","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-cardinal]]","[[../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-comb9-transversal-number-witness"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-comb9-transversal-number-witness</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-comb9-transversal-number-witness — ZFC Comb9 Transversal Number Witness"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"58-df-cardinal\">58-df-cardinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2be08d4ee8aa1590\" href=\"?note=2be08d4ee8aa1590\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md\">../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal A\">\\(\\mathcal A\\)</span> (family to be transversalized)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> (candidate transversal set)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> (candidate transversal number)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\)</span> (cardinal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"58-df-cardinal\">58-df-cardinal</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcComb9TransversalNumberWitness}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcComb9TransversalNumberWitness}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|A|\">\\(|A|\\)</span> 为集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 的唯一基数，使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"2be08d4ee8aa1590\" href=\"?note=2be08d4ee8aa1590\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md\">../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md</a> 的基数函数。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comb9\\text{-}transversal\\text{-}number\\text{-}witness} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcComb9TransversalNumberWitness}_S(X,\\mathcal A,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land X\\subseteq\\bigcup\\mathcal A\\land|X|=\\kappa\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathcal A\\;(X\\cap A\\neq\\emptyset)\\land\\forall\\lambda\\in\\kappa\\;\\neg\\exists Y\\subseteq\\bigcup\\mathcal A\\;\\bigl(|Y|=\\lambda\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathcal A\\;(Y\\cap A\\neq\\emptyset)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comb9\\text{-}transversal\\text{-}number\\text{-}witness} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcComb9TransversalNumberWitness}_S(X,\\mathcal A,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land X\\subseteq\\bigcup\\mathcal A\\land|X|=\\kappa\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathcal A\\;(X\\cap A\\neq\\emptyset)\\land\\forall\\lambda\\in\\kappa\\;\\neg\\exists Y\\subseteq\\bigcup\\mathcal A\\;\\bigl(|Y|=\\lambda\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathcal A\\;(Y\\cap A\\neq\\emptyset)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The set <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> is a minimum-cardinality transversal (hitting set) for <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal A\">\\(\\mathcal A\\)</span>; this is distinct from an injective system of distinct representatives.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-cardinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md","status":"resolved","id":"2be08d4ee8aa1590","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S$ (cardinal predicate, see [[58-df-cardinal]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md","status":"resolved","id":"2be08d4ee8aa1590","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$|A|$ 为集合 $A$ 的唯一基数，使用 [[../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md]] 的基数函数。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal A","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcComb9TransversalNumberWitness}_S","display":false},{"tex":"|A|","display":false},{"tex":"A","di